WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.500
09:00 — Trip home. Sana opens the honeymoon trip on her phone — tickets, hotel, the shape of Istanbul — without diving into WhatsApp archaeology.

00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:13.000
11:00 — Flights. Flight details on the phone are readable at the gate; Kamran can glance without hunting a forwarded PDF.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:19.500
16:00 — iPad itinerary. Sofa iPad itinerary for the day plan; they argue about museums, not about which chat has the booking.

00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:26.000
20:00 — Docs laptop. Laptop document list before departure — passports, visas, confirmations — one trip, one checklist.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:32.500
21:00 — Budget. Budget on the laptop is illustrative; they set a calm ceiling and close the lid excited, not panicked.

